#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen.rst:25
msgid "Blur and Sharpen"
msgstr "Desenfocar e enfocar"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The *Blur and Sharpen* video effects category provides effects and "
#| "filters to blur or sharpen the clip. Combined with masks from the *Alpha, "
#| "Mask and Keying* category it is possible to apply them only to portions "
#| "of the clip. For more details about this technique see the :ref:`effects-"
#| "mask_apply` section of the documentation."
msgid ""
"The *Blur and Sharpen* video effects category provides effects and filters "
"to blur or sharpen the clip. Combined with masks from the *Alpha, Mask and "
"Keying* category it is possible to apply them only to portions of the clip. "
"For more details about this technique see the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/mask_apply` section of the documentation."
msgstr ""
"A categoría de efectos de vídeo de *desenfocar e enforcar* fornece efectos e "
"filtros para desenfocar e enfocar o fragmento. Poden combinarse con máscaras "
"da categoría de *alfa, máscaras e fotogramas clave* para aplicalos só a "
"partes do fragmento. Para máis información sobre a técnica, consulte a "
"sección :ref:`effects-mask_apply` da documentación."

